<title>USA: University of N. Texas bonds won by Rauscher Pierce.</title>
<headline>University of N. Texas bonds won by Rauscher Pierce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc. said it won $8.230 million of University of North Texas, consolidated university revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.844 percent.</p>
</text>
